flowchart TD
  A[Track A readiness results are ready] --> B[Create recommendation candidates]

  B --> B1[Best Azure Files option]
  B --> B2[Best Azure Blob option]
  B --> B3[Optional readiness-maximised option]

  B1 --> C1[Assign priority by readiness]
  B2 --> C2[Assign priority by readiness]
  B3 --> C3[Assign priority by readiness]

  C1 --> D[Collect all candidate priorities]
  C2 --> D
  C3 --> D

  D --> E{Blob access frequency is Hardly Never?}
  E -->|Yes| E1[Give Blob candidates higher priority]
  E -->|No| E2[Keep natural priority order]

  E1 --> F[Pick top priority candidate set]
  E2 --> F

  F --> G{More than one top candidate?}
  G -->|Yes| H[Show tied recommendations and tie note]
  G -->|No| I[Show single recommendation]

  H --> J[Render Track A Recommended section]
  I --> J

  subgraph Priority meaning
    P1[Highest: Ready recommended]
    P2[Next: Ready]
    P3[Next: Ready with Condition]
    P4[Next: Readiness maximised]
    P5[Lowest: Not Ready]
  end